WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hi, Morgan.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Can you hear me?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I don't see any email.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh…

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Maybe did you just send it to Whitney?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And not to me, that could be a possibility.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: barbecue board.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Carmen Cruickshank: No, thank you, thank you.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, okay. I'll give you guys a call.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: One second.

